# Glistening Deluge's sets are fixed as it resolves (CR 611.2c): a noncreature permanent that becomes a creature later
# in the turn gets neither the -1/-1 nor the additional -2/-2, though it is green (the ruling of 2023-04-14). Bot1's
# Esika's Chariot is an uncrewed Vehicle when the Deluge resolves (its two 2/2 green Cats die to -3/-3); Bot1 then casts
# Bonecrusher Giant and crews the Chariot with it, and the Chariot attacks as a 4/4 for 4.

